guageCode":"EN","Name":"<p>EXECUTIVE ROOM WITH BALCONY - FREE WIFI</p>","Text":"<p>Executive Room ranging from 18 to 30 m², equipped with air conditioning and a private bathroom with bathtub or shower. Balcony with view, perfect for moments of relaxation. 42\" flat-screen TV with satellite channels. Bath linen is changed daily, while bed linen is changed every 2 days. Courtesy set with bathrobe and slippers, hypoallergenic mattress, free WiFi, safe and minibar. Breakfast served in the room. Soundproofed room.</p>","ShortText":"Modern Design, Chromotherapy Light, FREE WIFI, Air Condition, LCD 42'' HD with Satellite Channels, Toiletries, Bathroom with Shower, Soundproofed, Nespresso Free"},{"LanguageCode":"FR","Name":"CHAMBRE EXECUTIVE AVEC BALCON - <font color=#008800>WIFI GRATUITO</font>","Text":"<p>Chambre Exécutive de 18 à 30 m², équipée de la climatisation et d’une salle de bain privative avec baignoire ou douche. Balcon avec vue, idéal pour des instants de détente. Téléviseur à écran plat 42\" avec chaînes satellites. Le linge de bain est changé tous les jours, tandis que le linge de lit est remplacé tous les 2 jours. Kit de courtoisie avec peignoir et chaussons, matelas hypoallergénique, WiFi gratuit, coffre-fort et minibar. Petit-déjeuner servi en chambre. Chambre insonorisée.</p>","ShortText":"Mobilier design, Chromothérapie, WI-FI GRATUIT, Climatisation, LCD 42'' HD avec chaînes satellite, Set de courtoisie, Chambre insonorisée, Nespresso gratuit. "},{"LanguageCode":"IT","Name":"CAMERA EXECUTIVE CON BALCONE - <font color=#008800>WIFI GRATUITO</font>","Text":"<p>Camera Executive di dimensioni variabili dai 18 ai 30 m², fornita di climatizzazione e bagno privato con vasca o doccia. Balcone con vista, ideale per momenti di relax. TV a schermo piatto da 42\" con canali satellitari. La biancheria da bagno viene cambiata ogni giorno, mentre la biancheria da letto ogni 2 giorni. Linea di cortesia con accappatoio e pantofole, materasso anallergico, WiFi gratuito, cassaforte e frigo minibar. Colazione servita in camera. Camera insonorizzata.</p>","ShortText":"Mobili Design, Cromoterapia, WIFI GRATUITO, Aria Condizionata, LCD 42'' HD con canali satellitari, Set cortesia, Camera Insonorizzata, Nespresso Free"},{"LanguageCode":"DE","Name":"EXECUTIVE-ZIMMER MIT BALKON – <font color=#008800>KOSTENLOSES WLAN</font>","Text":"<p>Executive-Zimmer mit einer Größe von 18 bis 30 m², ausgestattet mit Klimaanlage und eigenem Bad mit Badewanne oder Dusche. Balkon mit Aussicht, ideal zum Entspannen. 42-Zoll-Flachbildfernseher mit Satellitenkanälen. Die Handtücher werden täglich gewechselt, die Bettwäsche alle zwei Tage. Pflegeprodukte, Bademantel und Hausschuhe, antiallergische Matratze, kostenloses WLAN, Safe und Minibar. Das Frühstück wird auf dem Zimmer serviert. Schallisoliertes Zimmer.</p>","ShortText":"Designermöbel, Farbtherapie, KOSTENLOSES WLAN, Klimaanlage, 42-Zoll-HD-LCD-Fernseher mit Satellitenkanälen, Pflegeprodukte, schallisoliertes Zimmer, kostenlose Nespresso-Maschine"},{"LanguageCode":"PT","Name":"QUARTO EXECUTIVO COM VARANDA - <font color=#008800>WI-FI GRATUITO</font>","Text":"<p>Quarto Executivo com áreas que variam entre os 18 e os 30 m², equipado com ar condicionado e casa de banho privativa com banheira ou duche. Varanda com vista, ideal para momentos de relaxamento. Televisão de ecrã plano de 42\" com canais por satélite. A roupa de banho é trocada diariamente, enquanto a roupa de cama é trocada a cada 2 dias. Produtos de higiene pessoal com roupão e chinelos, colchão antialérgico, Wi-Fi gratuito, cofre e minibar. Pequeno-almoço servido no quarto. Quarto insonorizado.</p>","ShortText":"Mobiliário de design, cromoterapia, Wi-Fi gratuito, ar condicionado, televisão LCD de 42'' HD com canais por satélite, kit de cortesia, quarto insonorizado, Nespresso gratuito"},{"LanguageCode":"ES","Name":"HABITACIÓN EJECUTIVA CON BALCÓN - <font color=#008800>WIFI GRATUITO</font>","Text":"<p>Habitación Executive con una superficie que oscila entre los 18 y los 30 m², equipada con aire acondicionado y baño privado con bañera o ducha. Balcón con vistas, ideal para momentos de relax. Televisor de pantalla plana de 42\" con canales por satélite. Las toallas se cambian a diario, mientras que la ropa de cama se cambia cada dos días. Set de cortesía con albornoz y zapatillas, colchón hipoalergénico, wifi gratuito, caja fuerte y minibar. Desayuno servido en la habitación. Habitación insonorizada.</p>","ShortText":"Mobiliario de diseño, cromoterapia, WIFI GRATUITO, aire acondicionado, televisor LCD de 42'' HD con canales por satélite, set de cortesía, habitación insonorizada, Nespresso gratis"}],"Images":[{"Id":"ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","MediaType":"image/jpeg","Name":null,"Category":null,"Description":null,"Primary":true,"Order":1,"Formats":[{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/compressed/ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","FormatType":0},{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/small_card/ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","FormatType":1},{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/big_card/ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","FormatType":2},{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/square/ed7ef317-a413-4d6e-a9e6-46163e43912d","FormatType":3}]},{"Id":"13068d63-e08b-4a73-9ac3-4b72fe4a0042","Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/13068d63-e08b-4a73-9ac3-4b72fe4a0042","MediaType":"image/jpeg","Name":null,"Category":null,"Description":null,"Primary":false,"Order":2,"Formats":[{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/compressed/13068d63-e08b-4a73-9ac3-4b72fe4a0042","FormatType":0},{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/11287/small_card/13068d63-e08b-4a73-9ac3-4b72fe4a0042","FormatType":1},{"Url":"https://cdnfox.blastness.biz/media/accommodation/